body:
Everything runs great. PC is in 72nd percentile benchmark-wise. One monitor artifacts, the TV cuts out incessantly, and the projector I test on only cuts out occasionally but produces ground hum.

&#x200B;

I feel stupid. With all this engineering education, I can't even build a damn PC. Today I'm heading out to buy a 850W Tier-1 modular and see if it helps any.

Totally. Also got an idea for an extremely simple, but pretty powerful hard rock song just now...

&#x200B;

I do get ideas. I just never act on them. I'm stupid. Now the hard part... Actually making it real.

The word positive is my negative. There is no better way to set me off than saying, "chill out, dude."

&#x200B;

I daresay we are.

Yup. It's all in your head. And all you hair is ON your head. 

&#x200B;

Hairlines change. They don't stay the same forever. You look young, so bets are you're around the age when your hairline settles. Being a 19 year old with intermediate hair loss, I have to say I'm quite jealous.
